{"page":388,"verses":[{"verse_key":"28:22","surah":28,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا تَوَجَّهَ تِلْقَآءَ مَدْيَنَ قَالَ عَسَىٰ رَبِّىٓ أَن يَهْدِيَنِى سَوَآءَ ٱلسَّبِيلِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"As he made his way towards Midian, he was saying, ‘May my Lord guide me to the right way.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَمَّا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"walammā","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَوَجَّهَ","en_gloss":"he turned his face","transliteration":"tawajjaha","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تِلْقَآءَ","en_gloss":"towards","transliteration":"til'qāa","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَدْيَنَ","en_gloss":"Madyan","transliteration":"madyana","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"he said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَسَىٰ","en_gloss":"Perhaps","transliteration":"ʿasā","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَبِّىٓ","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَهْدِيَنِى","en_gloss":"will guide me","transliteration":"yahdiyanī","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَوَآءَ","en_gloss":"(to the) sound","transliteration":"sawāa","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","en_gloss":"way","transliteration":"l-sabīli","verse_key":"28:22"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٢٢","en_gloss":"(22)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"28:22"}]},{"verse_key":"28:23","surah":28,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا وَرَدَ مَآءَ مَدْيَنَ وَجَدَ عَلَيْهِ أُمَّةً مِّنَ ٱلنَّاسِ يَسْقُونَ وَوَجَدَ مِن دُونِهِمُ ٱمْرَأَتَيْنِ تَذُودَانِ ۖ قَالَ مَا خَطْبُكُمَا ۖ قَالَتَا لَا نَسْقِى حَتَّىٰ يُصْدِرَ ٱلرِّعَآءُ ۖ وَأَبُونَا شَيْخٌ كَبِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When he arrived at Midian’s waters, he found a group of men watering [their flocks], and beside them two women keeping their flocks back, so he said, ‘What is the matter with you two?’ They said, ‘We cannot water [our flocks] until the sheph